From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Otavio Salvador <otavio@ossystems.com.br>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 11:08:12 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(web): add chat width setting for wide screens

Backport of https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code/pull/11594 onto
v0.0.43-preview.20260925.2240. The setting overrides the upstream
--chat-content-max-width variable instead of introducing its own.
